{"unit_id":"TritiumWang__dsh-universal-worldbook#card-zh","repo":"TritiumWang/dsh-universal-worldbook","commit":"10808578147d53942775f34b01ba3a8a035172e7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 通用世界书是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 插件，可按关键词或常驻规则把匹配条目临时注入模型请求，不写进会话历史。它还提供 lore_lookup 工具，供主 agent 查询当前作用域启用的条目，并带有管理世界书、排序条目和调整作用域的界面。适合需要按对话动态补充背景或设定的用户；数据保存在 DSH_HOME/WorldBook，不需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["host-plugin.js:916-1002","host-plugin.js:1044-1125","client.js:1-6","host-plugin.js:49-50"]}
{"unit_id":"TritiumWang__dsh-universal-worldbook#card-en","repo":"TritiumWang/dsh-universal-worldbook","commit":"10808578147d53942775f34b01ba3a8a035172e7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Universal Worldbook inserts matched entries into model requests without saving them to session history. The main agent can query enabled entries with lore_lookup; a UI manages books and scopes. Data stays under DSH_HOME/WorldBook; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["host-plugin.js:916-1002","host-plugin.js:1044-1125","client.js:1-6","host-plugin.js:49-50"]}
